{
  // The Thousand Layers (docs/story/STORY.md "The Thousand Layers"): the faith that grew out of the story of the fold
  // (the storyline: the builders folded the five systems away from a threat, and the fold rolled out to infinity). Over
  // the generations the story was retold until it became scripture: each verse below bends one of the five fragments the
  // player can find (frag.threat, frag.fold, frag.reading, frag.silence, frag.switch; "bends" says how, for writers
  // only). Verses from the draft "Fragments and scripture" (https://claude.ai/artifact/N8XemUxW1d9rseLeDyTHxZ). Its people
  // are sincere and kind, its ritual is baking and its priests are Bakers: the joke is only ever in the pastry, the belief
  // is played straight. Most hold to the Covered Bowl (leave it alone); the Unrollers read the Two Hands as a promise and
  // wait for someone with keys. Its people in the world are the penal colony's Baker and laundress
  // (Story/Casts/PenalColony.json); its storylets are Story/Storylets/ThousandLayers.json.
