  "rivals": { "Ministry of Slop": 20 },
  "voice": "THE THOUSAND LAYERS",
  "courier": "Two novices in floured aprons carry the crate away between them, humming the Covered Bowl under their breath.",
  "scripture": [
    { "name": "The Hunger", "fragment": "frag.threat",
      "text": "Before the first layer there was the Hunger, and it had no face. It ate the dark and was not filled. Five houses heard it at the door, and each house held one thing the others lacked.",
      "bends": "the edge, a thing nobody could measure moving towards the five systems, has become a beast with an appetite" },
    { "name": "The Rolling", "fragment": "frag.fold",
      "text": "So the Five Bakers brought flour and fat and water and salt and patience, and they rolled the world from the middle out. And the Hunger was at the edge of the dough, and they rolled it in, and it was folded under, layer upon layer, and it is under still.",
      "bends": "the engineers of five systems have become five Bakers, and the design a recipe" },
    { "name": "The Long Night", "fragment": "frag.reading",
      "text": "On the first night the Bakers looked up and the sky had been cleared for them like a table. Do not grieve the empty sky. A clean table is a gift to those with work to do.",
      "bends": "the observatory found no reference stars: the roll never stopped and took everything else; the verse makes the missing stars a blessing, not a loss" },
    { "name": "The Covered Bowl", "fragment": "frag.silence",
      "text": "The dough is resting. Do not lift the cloth to look. Whoever lifts the cloth lets the cold in, and the rising is undone, and that one must answer to all who were hungry.",
      "bends": "the councils agreed it could be reversed, refused a vote and withdrew the records; the cover-up has become a holy rule: do not lift the cloth" },
    { "name": "The Two Hands", "fragment": "frag.switch",
      "text": "At the last there will come two hands to the oven door. One book says they come to open it, and all that was folded will be unrolled and made whole. The other says they come to hold it shut. The Bakers do not agree, and have agreed not to ask.",
      "bends": "the release takes two keys turned together (and a timer was never fitted); the release has become a prophecy, and the faithful disagree about it" }
  ],
